{"seq":2,"slug":"circadian-biology","title":"昼夜节律生物学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"suprachiasmatic-nucleus-and-clock-genes","title":"视交叉上核与时钟基因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology/suprachiasmatic-nucleus-and-clock-genes","wordCount":2716,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"melatonin-and-light-signaling","title":"褪黑素与光信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology/melatonin-and-light-signaling","wordCount":2632,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"chronotypes-and-social-jetlag","title":"时间型与社会性时差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology/chronotypes-and-social-jetlag","wordCount":2435,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"昼夜节律生物学\">昼夜节律生物学</h1><p>本章深入解析驱动睡眠-觉醒周期的生物钟系统——从分子层面的时钟基因到个体层面的时间型差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容概要\">内容概要</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>视交叉上核与时钟基因</strong>：SCN 作为&quot;主时钟&quot;如何通过转录-翻译反馈环路产生约 24 小时节律</li>\n<li><strong>褪黑素与光信号</strong>：光信号如何经由 ipRGC → SCN → 松果体通路调控褪黑素分泌</li>\n<li><strong>时间型与社会性时差</strong>：遗传决定的昼夜偏好如何与社会作息产生冲突，及其健康后果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>掌握昼夜节律机制有助于理解为何光照管理是改善睡眠的核心策略之一。</p>\n"}